  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Cities Programme South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports municipalities in South Africa to remove barriers to inclusive economic growth and prosperity. These outcomes will be realised by delivering proven, short-term, interconnected, enabling interventions for sustainable, resilient and integrated urban development.  Through increasing data-driven decision making capacity, economic upliftment to key districts, and targeted transport projects, these projects will reactivate economic investment opportunities in cities and strengthen governance mechanisms to implement inclusive development policies.</narrative>
  </description>
